      "text": "## Your open support tickets, summarized daily in Slack\n\nKeeping an eye on your support queue just got easier. Our new Slack integration posts a daily summary of your open support tickets to a channel you choose—so your team can stay informed where they already work.\n\nWhether you share updates in a dedicated support channel or a broader team channel, you can give the right people a regular view of what’s still open without manually putting together a daily recap.\n\n**With daily summaries in Slack, you can:**\n- **Keep open tickets visible.** Bring a daily snapshot of your support queue into your team’s conversations.\n- **Cut down on manual updates.** Spend less time compiling and sharing ticket summaries.\n- **Keep everyone on the same page.** Give your team a shared starting point for discussing outstanding support work.\n\nSlack keeps your team informed; your helpdesk remains the place to manage and resolve tickets.\n\n**Ready to bring your support queue into Slack?** Connect the integration and choose the channel where you’d like your daily summary to appear."
